            <td colspan="3" style="padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom">
              <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Transmission load statistics for Northern States Power Co. (a Wisconsin corporation) are included as part of the NSP System, which is filed in the quarterly report for Northern States Power Co. (a Minnesota corporation).</span>
            </td>
          </tr>
        </table>
      </div>
